WEBVTT

00:00:11.470 --> 00:00:15.840
1457, Testament Era     Mt. Yoshino

00:00:42.380 --> 00:00:48.910
Let us pass, let us pass

00:00:42.380 --> 00:00:48.910
Toorimase, toorimase

00:00:43.250 --> 00:00:46.830
April 20, 1648, Testament Era

00:00:49.150 --> 00:00:55.620
Where doth this narrow path lead?

00:00:49.150 --> 00:00:55.620
Ikaba izuko ga hosomichi nareba

00:00:49.210 --> 00:00:52.710
7:58 A.M., Cemetery in Okutama

00:00:56.010 --> 00:01:02.480
It doth lead to the gods in Heaven

00:00:56.010 --> 00:01:02.480
Tenjin moto he to itaru hosomichi

00:01:02.840 --> 00:01:09.250
Thou thoughts matter not for ye cannot pass

00:01:02.840 --> 00:01:09.250
Goiken gomuyou toorenu totemo

00:01:09.250 --> 00:01:16.100
To celebrate this child's tenth

00:01:09.250 --> 00:01:16.100
Kono ko no too no oiwai ni

00:01:16.650 --> 00:01:22.930
I must make an offering with these talismans

00:01:16.650 --> 00:01:22.930
Ryou no ofuda wo osame ni sanzu

00:01:23.450 --> 00:01:29.530
The path out is pleasant, but returning is scary

00:01:23.450 --> 00:01:29.530
Iki wa yoi nagi, kaeri wa kowaki

00:01:26.850 --> 00:01:30.310
1638 
 May the young lady 
 Horizon A., 
 rest in peace. 
 ~Residents of Musashi

00:01:29.930 --> 00:01:39.820
Can I pass despite my fears?

00:01:29.930 --> 00:01:39.820
Waga naka kowaki no tooshi kana?

00:01:40.670 --> 00:01:42.670
It's time I put an end to this.

00:02:05.250 --> 00:02:08.230
What do you see?

00:02:05.250 --> 00:02:08.230
Nani ga mieru?

00:02:08.230 --> 00:02:11.650
You've closed yourself off to love

00:02:08.230 --> 00:02:11.650
Ari no mama no kimi wa

00:02:11.650 --> 00:02:17.530
Until you grow innately strong

00:02:11.650 --> 00:02:17.530
Tsuyoku naru made itoshisa wo tojite

00:02:17.530 --> 00:02:20.610
What are you listening to?

00:02:17.530 --> 00:02:20.610
Nani wo kiku no?

00:02:20.610 --> 00:02:23.700
Shall I tell you about days long past

00:02:20.610 --> 00:02:23.700
Himitsu no kobeya de

00:02:23.700 --> 00:02:29.460
In our secret little room?

00:02:23.700 --> 00:02:29.460
Inishie no hibi katarou ka?

00:02:29.770 --> 00:02:32.750
Embraced in memories

00:02:29.770 --> 00:02:32.750
Kioku ni dakarete

00:02:32.750 --> 00:02:36.050
The mysteria crumbles

00:02:32.750 --> 00:02:36.050
Kudakareta mysteria

00:02:36.050 --> 00:02:38.920
Once you overcome this tragedy

00:02:36.050 --> 00:02:38.920
Higeki wo koete

00:02:38.920 --> 00:02:40.920
Offer a gentle prayer

00:02:38.920 --> 00:02:40.920
Odayaka na inori

00:02:40.920 --> 00:02:45.140
Owari ga hajimari

00:02:40.920 --> 00:02:45.140
Endings are just beginnings

00:02:45.140 --> 00:02:48.330
Shinsekai de hito wa mirai wo

00:02:45.140 --> 00:02:48.330
People toss aside all they have

00:02:48.330 --> 00:02:50.810
Bishu no you ni

00:02:48.330 --> 00:02:50.810
Without ever knowing

00:02:50.810 --> 00:02:54.440
Nomi hoseru ka sae shirazu

00:02:50.810 --> 00:02:54.440
If they could drink up the new world

00:02:54.440 --> 00:02:57.440
Subete houri nageta

00:02:54.440 --> 00:02:57.440
Like a savory wine

00:02:57.440 --> 00:03:00.650
Shinsekai wa tsumetai risei to

00:02:57.440 --> 00:03:00.650
The new world resides

00:03:00.650 --> 00:03:03.460
Kiseki no hazama

00:03:00.650 --> 00:03:03.460
Between boring logic and miracles

00:03:03.460 --> 00:03:12.330
Doushite koko de kimi to aeta no

00:03:03.460 --> 00:03:12.330
I wonder why this is where I first met you

00:03:16.530 --> 00:03:18.430
<i>Attention all civilians,</i>

00:03:17.610 --> 00:03:21.700
Those Lined Up Before the Horizon

00:03:18.430 --> 00:03:21.560
<i>Level: Quasi-Bahamut,
Aerial Metropolitan Ship Musashi</i>

00:03:21.560 --> 00:03:26.610
<i>shall ring the toll of 8:30 A.M.
courtesy of Musashi Ariadust Academy.</i>

00:03:26.910 --> 00:03:31.450
<i>We shall enter an information
black-out stealth mode at 10:00.</i>

00:03:31.450 --> 00:03:33.480
<i>We appreciate your cooperation.</i>

00:03:33.480 --> 00:03:34.150
<i>That is all.</i>

00:03:34.170 --> 00:03:36.170
Tama Industrial District

00:03:36.210 --> 00:03:38.590
8:40 A.M., Musashi Ariadust Academy

00:03:37.800 --> 00:03:38.650
Great!

00:03:39.110 --> 00:03:41.150
Class 3-Plum's all here!

00:03:41.500 --> 00:03:44.950
Let's get P.E. under way.

00:03:45.320 --> 00:03:49.110
I'm gonna race over to a
mafia-run office in Shinagawa

00:03:49.110 --> 00:03:52.150
to roughen those jerks up a wee bit.

00:03:52.150 --> 00:03:53.870
So, try to keep up!

00:03:54.100 --> 00:03:56.000
That's when the real lesson begins.

00:03:56.000 --> 00:03:58.300
Anyone late will get morning cleaning duty.

00:03:58.980 --> 00:04:00.130
So, watcha say?

00:04:00.480 --> 00:04:01.720
Judgment!

00:04:02.470 --> 00:04:03.760
Ms. O.!

00:04:04.060 --> 00:04:05.480
Yes, Shirojiro?

00:04:05.480 --> 00:04:08.220
How are thugs related to P.E.?

00:04:08.640 --> 00:04:09.520
Is it money?

00:04:09.690 --> 00:04:14.410
Shiro, they drove her out of her home,
forcing her to move to the bottom level.

00:04:14.410 --> 00:04:17.520
Then, the school faculty scolded her
for crushing a wall when she snapped.

00:04:17.520 --> 00:04:20.920
She brought that second half on herself.

00:04:20.920 --> 00:04:23.070
Out for vengeance, Ms. O.?

00:04:23.480 --> 00:04:25.500
It's not vengeance!

00:04:25.500 --> 00:04:28.160
I'm just getting some payback
'cause I'm pissed.

00:04:29.430 --> 00:04:31.020
Vengeance, vengeance!

00:04:31.020 --> 00:04:31.580
Yep.

00:04:31.580 --> 00:04:32.750
Vengeance!

00:04:34.850 --> 00:04:36.790
Is anyone absent today?

00:04:36.790 --> 00:04:39.550
Aside from Miriam and Azuma, that is.

00:04:39.860 --> 00:04:43.740
As far as I can tell,
Seijun and the Chancellor are absent.

00:04:43.740 --> 00:04:46.550
Masazumu is working part-time as
an elementary school teacher.

00:04:46.550 --> 00:04:48.750
President Sakai's picking her up
this afternoon,

00:04:48.750 --> 00:04:50.180
so it's an excused absence.

00:04:50.500 --> 00:04:53.020
Does anyone know where Tori is?

00:04:54.440 --> 00:04:57.730
Are you all that curious about
my foolish brother Tori?

00:04:58.010 --> 00:04:59.480
I bet you are!

00:04:59.480 --> 00:05:03.190
After all, he's Musashi's Chancellor and
President of the Student Council.

00:05:05.460 --> 00:05:07.240
But I won't tell!

00:05:08.990 --> 00:05:13.960
He was gone by the time I,
Bel Flore Aoi, awoke around 8:30.

00:05:13.960 --> 00:05:18.410
My foolish brother got up early
and failed to make me breakfast.

00:05:18.410 --> 00:05:20.090
I hope he goes to Hell!

00:05:20.460 --> 00:05:23.480
Say, Kimi, you changed
your stage name again?

00:05:23.480 --> 00:05:24.980
That's right, Margot!

00:05:24.980 --> 00:05:27.660
Call me Bel Flore! Got it?!

00:05:27.660 --> 00:05:29.800
Wasn't it Josephine three days ago?

00:05:29.800 --> 00:05:34.080
Not since Nakamura from
three classes over named her dog that!

00:05:34.080 --> 00:05:35.310
Got it?!

00:05:36.000 --> 00:05:38.160
So, Tori has an unexcused tardy.

00:05:38.160 --> 00:05:39.530
But that's to be expected of our Chancellor

00:05:39.530 --> 00:05:43.030
since the Far East Musashi is under the
Testament Union's provisional rule.

00:05:44.420 --> 00:05:46.180
Under the premise of recreating history,

00:05:46.180 --> 00:05:49.650
academy students serve as representatives
for countries around the world.

00:05:49.650 --> 00:05:52.030
Since various countries rule the Far East,

00:05:52.030 --> 00:05:56.180
the Testament Union wanted someone
convenient to serve as our representative.

00:05:56.180 --> 00:05:57.670
That's Tori Aoi.

00:05:59.100 --> 00:06:02.760
They always choose students with
horrible aptitude like him.

00:06:04.280 --> 00:06:07.800
They even gave him the nickname
"Impossible."

00:06:07.800 --> 00:06:10.990
This has been going on for over 160 years.

00:06:10.990 --> 00:06:15.380
All of the Divine States originally
belonged to us, the Far East.

00:06:15.380 --> 00:06:18.600
But they make us bow to their will,
assist them and fork over money.

00:06:18.860 --> 00:06:21.740
We're always in transit and lack the power

00:06:21.740 --> 00:06:24.930
to make Musashi here the
heart of the Far East.

00:06:27.080 --> 00:06:30.940
Other countries don't have an
age-limit for their students,

00:06:30.940 --> 00:06:33.250
but we have to graduate by age 18.

00:06:33.560 --> 00:06:36.200
Anyone older is prohibited from
government or military affairs.

00:06:36.420 --> 00:06:40.540
Don't you think talking like
that's kinda dangerous?

00:06:40.860 --> 00:06:42.370
I'm fine.

00:06:43.060 --> 00:06:46.710
They don't have time to listen in
on everything we say.

00:06:46.970 --> 00:06:49.780
We're just about to enter
Mikawa's territory and all.

00:06:49.960 --> 00:06:52.400
Ain't you mature?

00:06:53.070 --> 00:06:57.790
Bluntly put, our country's been
wrung through the wringer.

00:06:57.790 --> 00:07:01.400
So then, have you decided
what you're gonna do?

00:07:05.420 --> 00:07:06.720
Excellent!

00:07:06.720 --> 00:07:10.150
Now's the time to bring it on
if you've got any skill at fighting.

00:07:10.630 --> 00:07:11.890
The rules are simple.

00:07:12.190 --> 00:07:17.540
I'll give you five free absences
if you hit me before I reach that office.

00:07:17.830 --> 00:07:19.100
You got that?

00:07:19.440 --> 00:07:20.870
You can play hooky five times!

00:07:21.000 --> 00:07:21.870
Ma'am!

00:07:22.440 --> 00:07:25.880
You want us to actually hit you,
not graze you?

00:07:25.880 --> 00:07:28.300
You battle types are so nit-picky.

00:07:28.300 --> 00:07:29.580
You heard right.

00:07:29.580 --> 00:07:30.800
And it's free-style.

00:07:31.050 --> 00:07:36.650
Is there anywhere we'd get points
deducted for touching or groping?

00:07:36.650 --> 00:07:39.730
Inversely, are there any bonus point areas?

00:07:42.060 --> 00:07:44.190
Would you like to die before we start class?

00:07:45.780 --> 00:07:46.400
Well then...

00:07:48.660 --> 00:07:50.070
Class is in session!

00:07:54.140 --> 00:07:55.530
C'mon, slowpokes!

00:07:57.430 --> 00:07:58.580
Charge!

00:08:05.920 --> 00:08:07.380
1638 
 May the young lady 
 Horizon A., 
 rest in peace. 
 ~Residents of Musashi

00:08:12.060 --> 00:08:13.950
<i>Horizon, huh?</i>

00:08:13.950 --> 00:08:18.600
<i>I'm sure that name will spell a new
beginning for those kids.</i>

00:08:19.040 --> 00:08:21.290
8:50 A.M., Blue Thunder in Tama

00:08:38.440 --> 00:08:39.820
Looking good, guys!

00:08:39.820 --> 00:08:41.670
Keep doling out the dough!

00:08:41.140 --> 00:08:42.890
Seal the Deal

00:08:41.670 --> 00:08:44.120
Thank you for sealing the deal!

00:08:44.120 --> 00:08:45.080
Here you go!

00:08:44.190 --> 00:08:45.060
Sec.3-Revised
Divide

00:08:45.670 --> 00:08:47.790
Thanks again!

00:08:53.170 --> 00:08:54.940
Take that!

00:09:02.630 --> 00:09:04.730
Oh, Adele, you're up first?

00:09:05.140 --> 00:09:07.440
I take pride in my fast legs.

00:09:09.460 --> 00:09:12.520
I, Retainer Adele Balfetto,
will use my First Lance!

00:09:12.380 --> 00:09:12.530
Speed Boost

00:09:27.410 --> 00:09:29.650
Care for some curry?

00:09:33.880 --> 00:09:35.090
You got me!

00:09:35.800 --> 00:09:37.220
I'm sorry...

00:09:37.220 --> 00:09:38.210
Upsy daisy!

00:09:38.210 --> 00:09:39.700
Owie!

00:09:43.470 --> 00:09:46.200
Hey, Adele and Hassan have retired!

00:09:45.960 --> 00:09:48.670
Currently Praying

00:09:46.200 --> 00:09:48.690
Itoken, help Nenji tend to them.

00:09:51.410 --> 00:09:53.370
I'm nothing to be afraid of!

00:09:53.370 --> 00:09:56.610
I'm the lewd spirit, the incubus Kenji Ito!

00:09:57.010 --> 00:10:00.120
Everyone from the shopping district,
please pardon our conduct.

00:10:01.470 --> 00:10:03.700
Help is on the way, Lady Adele!

00:10:04.450 --> 00:10:05.710
Nenji!

00:10:05.710 --> 00:10:08.520
Oopsies! I'm sorry, Nenji!

00:10:08.520 --> 00:10:11.220
I feel bad, honest!

00:10:11.220 --> 00:10:15.050
Kimi, sound more sincere
when you apologize!

00:10:15.050 --> 00:10:16.630
Be a lady!

00:10:16.910 --> 00:10:19.140
You wretched lecturing monster!

00:10:19.830 --> 00:10:23.030
So Mitotsudaira, why are you
running on foot?

00:10:23.030 --> 00:10:25.350
Why aren't you using that crazy
chain move like usual?

00:10:25.580 --> 00:10:28.190
This land falls under my domain!

00:10:28.190 --> 00:10:30.100
And you're destroying it!

00:10:30.390 --> 00:10:34.190
You're just howling because of your
inability as a knight to best our teacher.

00:10:34.190 --> 00:10:36.740
You're such a heavy tank type!

00:10:36.890 --> 00:10:38.490
Excuse me!

00:10:39.900 --> 00:10:41.490
That was a close call.

00:10:41.930 --> 00:10:44.800
Nenji, be more careful.

00:10:44.800 --> 00:10:46.040
Fear not!

00:10:46.430 --> 00:10:49.140
I was sure to go into
a good defensive position.

00:10:49.140 --> 00:10:50.060
You were?

00:10:51.480 --> 00:10:52.480
Open for Business
But
Shopkeeper is Out on Delivery

00:10:53.170 --> 00:10:55.500
Aren't you going to close shop?

00:10:55.500 --> 00:10:57.090
We sure aren't.

00:10:57.090 --> 00:11:00.870
It's shameful for a store to close down
in the middle of the workday,

00:11:00.870 --> 00:11:02.880
and she understands that.

00:11:02.880 --> 00:11:06.260
Even now, she's waiting for someone
to drop by for breakfast.

00:11:06.260 --> 00:11:07.830
She's got guts.

00:11:10.400 --> 00:11:11.310
Well?

00:11:11.310 --> 00:11:13.520
We keep missing, but we'll get her.

00:11:16.970 --> 00:11:19.400
Musashi, cleaning first thing in the morning?

00:11:19.660 --> 00:11:22.460
Judge, President Sakai. Over.

00:11:22.460 --> 00:11:24.700
Rapid fire unblessed shots, eh?

00:11:25.260 --> 00:11:28.040
There are some spells like that too.

00:11:28.040 --> 00:11:30.750
It's sufficient for long, straight
stretches like on a roof,

00:11:31.280 --> 00:11:33.110
but not in the industrial district.

00:11:33.110 --> 00:11:35.250
The close-range combat types should step in.

00:11:40.820 --> 00:11:42.010
Go for it!

00:11:44.840 --> 00:11:46.930
I was expecting you about now.

00:11:46.930 --> 00:11:49.440
Style: Ninja Force, Tenzo!

00:11:50.760 --> 00:11:51.480
En garde!

00:11:58.070 --> 00:12:00.070
You're up, Sir Urqui!

00:12:00.070 --> 00:12:00.940
Right!

00:12:00.940 --> 00:12:02.200
That's lame!

00:12:05.700 --> 00:12:07.330
Not gonna use your weapon?

00:12:07.500 --> 00:12:11.010
My inquisitor weapon is not meant
for those of the Shinto faith.

00:12:11.010 --> 00:12:13.960
As such, I shall strike you down
with my own hands.

00:12:14.420 --> 00:12:15.540
You keep dreaming!

00:12:22.170 --> 00:12:23.140
Sir Nori!

00:12:26.130 --> 00:12:27.530
So, Noriki's the real threat!

00:12:27.530 --> 00:12:30.020
You don't have to shout it out!

00:12:36.180 --> 00:12:37.050
A pity.

00:12:37.050 --> 00:12:38.110
Truly mortifying.
A pity.

00:12:40.960 --> 00:12:43.660
It's up to you now, Lady Asama!

00:12:57.500 --> 00:12:59.290
Persona, give her a lift!

00:13:11.970 --> 00:13:13.500
Coordinate lock-on!

00:13:15.260 --> 00:13:18.420
She's more like a real Amazon than a teacher.

00:13:19.330 --> 00:13:20.250
Here I go!

00:13:20.250 --> 00:13:23.700
I shall use a ritual Shinto spell
by way of the Asama Shrine.

00:13:26.950 --> 00:13:29.740
I will present ritual offerings
for Asama's divine help.

00:13:30.020 --> 00:13:34.840
Hanami, purify my shot so it won't fall short,
get diverted or obstructed.

00:13:34.840 --> 00:13:39.020
That combined with my scope makes it
a Level 4 wish to the gods.

00:13:39.020 --> 00:13:42.890
It's a Level 4 spell,
so can you make four offerings?

00:13:42.890 --> 00:13:46.570
I will give you the Five Sacred Grains
for lunch and dinner.

00:13:46.840 --> 00:13:48.770
I'll perform the Kagura dance for two hours,

00:13:48.770 --> 00:13:51.120
take you on a walk and chit-chat with you.

00:13:51.120 --> 00:13:52.620
That's four ritual offerings.

00:13:52.620 --> 00:13:54.520
If that's okay, give me your blessings.

00:13:56.680 --> 00:13:58.240
Yup, permission granted.

00:13:58.240 --> 00:13:58.810
Clap!

00:14:02.670 --> 00:14:04.360
Artificial eye "Konoha" has locked on!

00:14:05.130 --> 00:14:06.200
Fire!

00:14:08.270 --> 00:14:10.200
You can't just knock this one aside.

00:14:10.200 --> 00:14:11.400
It will swing around!

00:14:15.490 --> 00:14:16.460
Did you get her?

00:14:20.220 --> 00:14:22.010
So much for dessert!

00:14:22.010 --> 00:14:23.210
What happened?

00:14:24.280 --> 00:14:27.680
Her hair! She cut her hair
and put it in the arrow's flight path.

00:14:27.680 --> 00:14:32.350
The spell dissipated when it chaffed her hair,
thinking it had hit home.

00:14:36.300 --> 00:14:37.810
A..Asama...

00:14:38.120 --> 00:14:41.360
But last year you couldn't even
make her cut her hair.

00:14:49.030 --> 00:14:50.490
It missed!

00:14:53.360 --> 00:14:55.010
There's Shinagawa!

00:14:56.390 --> 00:14:58.190
Margot, let's do it!

00:14:58.190 --> 00:14:59.560
You got it, Gacchan!

00:14:59.560 --> 00:15:01.130
Don't rush or you'll get hurt.

00:15:07.470 --> 00:15:08.300
Let's do it!

00:15:08.650 --> 00:15:10.880
We're the black and white magi gunners.

00:15:13.860 --> 00:15:16.310
It's the Fallen Angel and
Descended Angel Ensemble!

00:15:23.480 --> 00:15:26.360
So, the spell-types are finally catching up?

00:15:26.360 --> 00:15:30.780
I take it you're here to slow me down
while they prepare their spells.

00:15:33.060 --> 00:15:34.460
Exactly.

00:15:34.460 --> 00:15:37.780
We won't use Schwarze Frauen
and Weiss Frauen

00:15:37.780 --> 00:15:39.780
since we're in the middle of class.

00:15:40.010 --> 00:15:41.460
C'mon, Gacchan!

00:15:41.460 --> 00:15:43.000
You got it, Margot!

00:15:53.470 --> 00:15:54.720
Herrlich!

00:15:58.810 --> 00:16:01.810
Your attempt to buy time is gonna
knock everyone out!

00:16:02.180 --> 00:16:04.100
T..Trying to kill us?!

00:16:04.330 --> 00:16:05.560
Sorry!

00:16:05.900 --> 00:16:08.280
They almost got her too...

00:16:08.820 --> 00:16:14.630
It is highly unlikely they will succeed
now that she's in Shinagawa. Over.

00:16:14.630 --> 00:16:17.770
Say, Musashi, shouldn't you
be on the bridge?

00:16:18.880 --> 00:16:21.880
We've already crossed the
perilous Sagarmatha Corridor

00:16:21.880 --> 00:16:25.040
and we are all set and ready
to enter Mikawa's port.

00:16:25.040 --> 00:16:27.120
I've got time to kill. Over.

00:16:27.120 --> 00:16:28.250
Mikawa, eh?

00:16:28.630 --> 00:16:32.670
Some of my old pals have
been asking to see me.

00:16:33.090 --> 00:16:35.510
Mikawa is currently in turmoil.

